Lance first appeared in The Challenger. He was first seen talking about , the first in a long time to collect eight Gym Badges, with the rest of the Kanto Elite Four, and he instructed his colleagues to prepare themselves for the upcoming challenger. Later, he was the last of the Elite Four to be challenged by Blue. After a heated battle, Blue's defeated Lance's off-screen, making Blue the new Pokémon League Champion.

Lance reappeared in The Lake of Rage. He and were seen infiltrating the Team Rocket HQ in Mahogany Town, destroying the radio wave generator and ruining Team Rocket's plans to force Pokémon to evolve.
